For the aforesaid reasons and discussions, we proceed go pass the following:
ORDER 1. Appeal is partly allowed;
2. IA.I of 2014 filed under Order XLI Rule 27 read with Section 151 of Code of Civil Procedure is allowed;
3. Matter is remitted back to the Tribunal only to the extent of determining the income of the deceased on the basis of the additional documents and to re-determine the compensation under the head "loss of dependency" to enable the appellant to Smt. Shaila W/O Manjappa K.D vs The Managing Director on 21 June, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/174117064/
7 adduce additional evidence as sought for;
4.

The Tribunal shall dispose of the matter as expeditiously as possible, as the matter is of the year 2015;
7. Registry to transmit copy of this judgment along with IA.I of 2024 along with documents if any,
and the trial Court records to the concerned court forthwith.

